pliant with her medication. She denies any recent episodes of hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia.\nO: BP 148/88 Wt 202 lb BMI 30.4 Exam: Physical exam was within normal limits, no significant findings.\nA: Type 2 diabetes - stable, with A1c 6.2.\nP: Continue with current treatment of metformin 1000 mg. Discussed the importance of regular physical activity and dietary management. Advised on the importance of regular eye exams due to her diabetes. RTC 3-6 months for follow-up.\n\n--- 10/23/2023 Office Visit ---\nS: Ms. Love presents for follow-up of her Type 2 diabetes. She reports feeling well overall, with no rece"
